#NEXUS

[ carpenter2018b_fig3: Ornithischian summary cladogram, vertical (root at the bottom). Internal labels: Ornithischia (root stem tick), Genasauria and Cerapoda (dots), Neornithischia and Ornithopoda (stem ticks), Dryomorpha (dot; the Iguanodontia tick sits on the same stem). Ticks on terminal branches (Heterodontosauridae on Fruitadens, Ankylopollexia on Camptosaurus, Dryosauridae on Dryosaurus) label single tips and are not encoded. 8 tips, fully resolved; 6 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=8;
    TAXLABELS
        Fruitadens
        Thyreophora
        Nanosaurus
        Thescelosauridae
        Marginocephalia
        Hypsilophodontidae
        Camptosaurus
        Dryosaurus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE carpenter2018b_fig3 = [&R] (Fruitadens,(Thyreophora,(Nanosaurus,(Thescelosauridae,(Marginocephalia,(Hypsilophodontidae,(Camptosaurus,Dryosaurus)Dryomorpha)Ornithopoda)Cerapoda))Neornithischia)Genasauria)Ornithischia;
END;
